WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.140
…low Earth orbit.

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:03.980
But the way they do it is a little bit different.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:07.100
The space shuttle also can take large payload into orbit.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:08.700
So it requires a huge amount of fuel

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.120
to get the space shuttle into low Earth orbit.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.540
And the solid rocket boosters,

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:15.880
when you first light off and get off the launch pad,

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.000
you're kind of shaking, you're rocking and rolling.
